      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-01-13T18:27:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does the build already have a similar problem when unpacking zips/jar files that it creates which have Jan 1 1970 timestamps? If so then we should probably do what it does.\n\nIn the meantime would you mind sending me a patch so I can update the file?",
      "parentUuid": "c2896dcd_c1142eb1",
      "revId": "8fff3dfe76abd2f7a73be7e7aca24b808cbc46e9",
